        "created_at": "2014-04-12T17:11:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have a few questions regarding these topics and was hoping to get some sort of officialish answers.</p><p>Will the Add-On pack be sold as one item, or (assuming more is unlocked)as mini expansions (ala Unity, Ambuscade, etc in SotM) in retail?</p><p>Will painted minis be available via retail? Will all future sets sold at retail also have painted miniatures? I'm very tempted to up my pledge for the painted minis, but if Core Set 2+ did not have the option of painted minis I'd rather have all my minis be unpainted, as I'd want them to match.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
