        "raw": "<p>I have a few questions regarding these topics and was hoping to get some sort of officialish answers.</p><p>Will the Add-On pack be sold as one item, or (assuming more is unlocked)as mini expansions (ala Unity, Ambuscade, etc in SotM) in retail?</p><p>Will painted minis be available via retail? Will all future sets sold at retail also have painted miniatures? I&#39;m very tempted to up my pledge for the painted minis, but if Core Set 2+ did not have the option of painted minis I&#39;d rather have all my minis be unpainted, as I&#39;d want them to match.</p>",
