      {
        "id": 99124,
        "name": "boxwood",
        "username": "boxwood",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-12T18:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>About the add on pack I have no idea, but I would assume that it would eventually be a second expansion, since the 215,000 stretch looks to be a mobile defense platform. The blade battalion minis would pair nicely with that. I think this all depends on how much is unlocked through the kickstarter though.</p>\n<p>Some where in the kickstarter answers they mentioned that they would continue to sell painted minis. I don’t know how long that will go on, I also don’t know if they would continue to paint future minis, but I assume they might.</p>\n<p>You’ll probably have to wait for an official answer after PAX East. Hope I helped.</p>",
