        "raw": "About the add on pack I have no idea, but I would assume that it would eventually be a second expansion, since the 215,000 stretch looks to be a mobile defense platform. The blade battalion minis would pair nicely with that. I think this all depends on how much is unlocked through the kickstarter though.\r\n\r\nSome where in the kickstarter answers they mentioned that they would continue to sell painted minis. I don't know how long that will go on, I also don't know if they would continue to paint future minis, but I assume they might.\r\n\r\nYou'll probably have to wait for an official answer after PAX East. Hope I helped.",
