      {
        "id": 99125,
        "name": "Karrde",
        "username": "Karrde",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/c0e974/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-04-14T01:50:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"grim88\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/c77e96/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grim88:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have a few questions regarding these topics and was hoping to get some sort of officialish answers.Will the Add-On pack be sold as one item, or (assuming more is unlocked)as mini expansions (ala Unity, Ambuscade, etc in SotM) in retail?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>From GtG in the main comments (in response to a commenter not wanting the minis included in the bundle):</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"GtG\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/838e76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> GtG:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes, they totally will. If you don't care about minis, don't bother picking up this add-on. Just get the maps separately next year when they come out.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p> My assumption is the things in the add-on will be sold individually, similar to how Unity, Ambuscade, etc are sold now. But that's just my current assumption. </p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"grim88\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/c77e96/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> grim88:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Will painted minis be available via retail? Will all future sets sold at retail also have painted miniatures? I'm very tempted to up my pledge for the painted minis, but if Core Set 2+ did not have the option of painted minis I'd rather have all my minis be unpainted, as I'd want them to match.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>From GtG in Update 11 <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinel-tactics-the-flame-of-freedom/posts/800401#comments\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">comments</a>:</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"GtG\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/838e76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> GtG:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Now that we are making painted as well as unpainted miniatures, it is our intention to continue both lines for as long as we are making miniatures.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Edit: Posted before I finished formatting. Oops.</p>",
