        "raw": "[quote=\"grim88\"]\n I have a few questions regarding these topics and was hoping to get some sort of officialish answers.Will the Add-On pack be sold as one item, or (assuming more is unlocked)as mini expansions (ala Unity, Ambuscade, etc in SotM) in retail?  \n[/quote]\n \n\nFrom GtG in the main comments (in response to a commenter not wanting the minis included in the bundle):\n\n \n[quote=\"GtG\"]\nYes, they totally will. If you don&#39;t care about minis, don&#39;t bother picking up this add-on. Just get the maps separately next year when they come out.\n[/quote]\n \n\n<font color=\"#0b1902\" face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, Liberation Sans, FreeSans, sans-serif\"> My assumption is the things in the add-on will be sold individually, similar to how Unity, Ambuscade, etc are sold now. But that&#39;s just my current assumption. </font>\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[quote=\"grim88\"]\nWill painted minis be available via retail? Will all future sets sold at retail also have painted miniatures? I&#39;m very tempted to up my pledge for the painted minis, but if Core Set 2+ did not have the option of painted minis I&#39;d rather have all my minis be unpainted, as I&#39;d want them to match. \n[/quote]\n \n\nFrom GtG in Update 11 <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinel-tactics-the-flame-of-freedom/posts/800401#comments\">comments</a>:\n\n \n[quote=\"GtG\"]\nNow that we are making painted as well as unpainted miniatures, it is our intention to continue both lines for as long as we are making miniatures.\n[/quote]\n \n\n&nbsp;\n\n Edit: Posted before I finished formatting. Oops. \n",
